# fixture identity: chest
# fixture element: wooden body box with darker inset panels
# fixture element: metal bands wrapping the lid and front face
# fixture element: centered lock plate on the front
# fixture element: raised lid with stepped arch profile
# fixture element: four small feet under the body
# fixture asymmetry: one extra left-side hinge rivet and side latch breaks bilateral symmetry
# fixture stressor-silhouette: iconic silhouette readability from compact chest proportions and raised lid
# fixture stressor-material: trim/lock detail survival and material separation across wood, dark inset, metal, and shadow materials
# fixture stressor-view: lid/body readability at 64x64 across front and three-quarter views
model chest
size 16 10 10
palette phase0Props
color warmWood #8a4f2a
color darkWood #4b2a18
color agedMetal #8e8f84
color lockGold #d6a33f
color shadow #21170f
material body warmWood
material inset darkWood
material band agedMetal
material lock lockGold
material dark shadow

# lower chest body and panels
fill body 2..13 1..7 1..5
fill inset 3..12 2..6 1..1
fill inset 3..12 2..6 5..5

# raised / arched lid approximation
fill body 3..12 2..6 6..7
fill body 4..11 3..5 8..8
fill body 5..10 4..4 9..9

# metal bands and front lock details
fill band 3..4 1..7 0..8
fill band 11..12 1..7 0..8
fill band 2..13 7..7 1..7
fill lock 7..8 0..0 3..5
voxel dark 7 0 2
voxel dark 8 0 2

# feet and asymmetric extra hardware
fill dark 2..3 0..0 1..2
fill dark 12..13 0..0 1..2
fill dark 2..3 0..0 5..6
fill dark 12..13 0..0 5..6
voxel band 1 4 4
voxel lock 1 4 5
voxel band 2 4 5
